// @FIGURE_CODE_BEGIN
// ── Element spec ──
// 2D right-half fill → ShapeGeometry (axis to right-branch curve), #f3a878 opacity 0.85
// 2D left-half meridians → ~18 Line curves at projected azimuths, #d97742
// 2D central axis → dashed Line (0,0,0)→(0,3.592,0), #444
